=2 Walkthrough
Complete the path that you started in the previous Mission.
=3 {z:Selbina} path
* Purchase from the {z:Auction House} or farm 3x {@i:Bee Pollen|9082} {i:Bee Pollen|Bee Pollen|9082} from {m:Huge Wasps|Huge Wasp} in {z:La Theine Plateau} or {z:Konschtat Highlands}.
** If you choose to farm the Pollen, the best area is in {z:Konschtat Highlands} around the {p:Crag of Dem}. There are about 12-15 spawns that you will find as you run around the Crag, and by the time you make a lap they will have respawned.
** In {z:La Theine Plateau}, the spawns are spread out with only 3-4 at each of the valleys.
** Be sure to use {p:Wide Scan} under your Map menu to help find the {m:Huge Wasps|Huge Wasp}.
* Return to {z:Selbina} and trade the pollen to {n:Abelard} (G-9). He is in the next room from the start of the previous mission.

=3 {z:Mhaura} path
* Purchase from the {z:Auction House} or farm 3x {@i:Mandra. Dewdrop|9083} {i:Mandragora Dewdrop|Mandra. Dewdrop|9083}s off the {m:Pygmaioi} in {z:Tahrongi Canyon}.
** Be sure to use {p:Wide Scan} under your Map menu to help find the {m:Pygmaioi}.
* Return to {z:Mhaura} and trade the dewdrops to {n:Ekokoko}.

----
=3 Afterward
\**{c=red:NOTE:}** If you are a new player and you have not yet unlocked your {p:Support Job} (a.k.a. {p:subjob|Subjob}) you will receive the {@k} {k:Gilgamesh's introductory letter}. If you have already unlocked your {p:Support Job}, your reward will be a {@i:Copper Voucher|8711} {i:Copper A.M.A.N. Voucher|Copper Voucher|8711}.
* {k:Gilgamesh's introductory letter} allows you to unlock your {p:Support Job} easier and earlier than before: After reaching Level 18+, speak to either {n:Isacio} in {z:Selbina} (G-10) twice, or {n:Vera} in {z:Mhaura} (G-10) twice to unlock your {p:Support Job}!

